# Project development

Before making any change in this repo, read and follow
`.claude/skills/project-development/SKILL.md` — the authoritative workflow for
developing and shipping this service onto its k3s cluster. `CLAUDE.md` carries
the standing rules and the doc index.

The rules that must hold in every change, restated here because they are the
ones that cost real damage:

- Flux owns all Kubernetes state under `kubernetes/flux/`. Never `kubectl apply`
  or `helm upgrade` to deploy — preview with `kustomize build kubernetes/flux`
  and deploy by merging.
- Never push to `main`; branch → {{ change_request }}, always.
- Never commit secrets — reference them from `ExternalSecret` manifests.
- Containers stay non-root with a read-only root filesystem; no `latest` tags.
- Stay within this repo's single namespace.
